WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.130
Every form starts on your dashboard.

2
00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.830
Click New form, and a blank page opens.

3
00:00:06.183 --> 00:00:07.763
Tally works like a document.

4
00:00:08.103 --> 00:00:10.363
Click the title and give it a clear name,

5
00:00:10.503 --> 00:00:11.603
like Customer feedback.

6
00:00:12.983 --> 00:00:14.703
Press slash to add a block.

7
00:00:14.923 --> 00:00:15.963
Pick Short answer.

8
00:00:16.263 --> 00:00:18.423
Then type your question, like what do you like

9
00:00:18.423 --> 00:00:19.443
most about our product.

10
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:22.870
Add as many questions as you need.

11
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:25.390
Press slash again and pick Long answer,

12
00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:27.310
for anything else they want to tell you.

13
00:00:28.783 --> 00:00:29.703
Happy with it?

14
00:00:29.843 --> 00:00:30.483
Click Publish.

15
00:00:30.743 --> 00:00:32.563
Your form goes live right away,

16
00:00:32.563 --> 00:00:33.763
and you get a link to share.

17
00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:38.473
Copy the link and send it to your customers,

18
00:00:38.473 --> 00:00:41.333
in an email, a chat, or your help center.

19
00:00:41.653 --> 00:00:43.973
You can also embed the form right on your

20
00:00:43.973 --> 00:00:46.713
website. Every answer is collected for you,

21
00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:48.993
and you can read them in the Submissions tab.

22
00:00:49.353 --> 00:00:51.753
The free plan has no limit on forms.
